    "上下轻扫调整档位，也可清空这一项": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Swipe up or down to change the grade, or clear this axis."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上下にスワイプして段階を調整します。この項目を消去することもできます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "东南亚": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Southeast Asia"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "東南アジア"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "东汉至今 · 东亚与东南亚": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eastern Han to today · East and Southeast Asia"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "後漢から現代まで · 東アジアと東南アジア"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "中国北方": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Northern China"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "中国北方"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "中国北方、中国南方、日本、东南亚与朝鲜半岛分别浏览。所有时期可从菜单切换；浅色带表示所选时期或年份范围，外圈表示选中圆点。数字是邻近年份的古迹数，半圆表示其中部分已到访。年代对应图版所绘主体，部分仅作约略定位，确切纪年与重修沿革以详情为准。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Northern China, Southern China, Japan, Southeast Asia and the Korean Peninsula are browsed separately. Every period can be chosen from the menu; the light band marks the selected period or range of years, and an outer ring marks the selected dot. Numbers count monuments in neighboring years, and a half-filled dot means some of them have been visited. Dates refer to the structure drawn on each plate; some are only approximate placements, so see the detail page for exact dates and later restorations."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "中国北方・中国南方・日本・東南アジア・朝鮮半島を個別に閲覧します。すべての時代はメニューから切り替えられます。淡い帯は選択した時代または年の範囲を、外側の輪は選択中の点を示します。数字は近い年代の古跡の数で、半円はその一部を訪問済みであることを示します。年代は図版に描かれた主体に対応し、一部はおおよその位置づけにすぎません。正確な紀年や修築の沿革は詳細ページを参照してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "中国南方": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Southern China"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "中国南方"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "亮色": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Light"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ライト"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "亮色如纸，深色如墨。跟随系统会随设备外观切换。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Light is like paper, dark like ink. System follows your device's appearance."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ライトは紙のように、ダークは墨のように。システムを選ぶとデバイスの外観に合わせて切り替わります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "亲见 · 所愿 · 私人记录": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seen · Wished for · Private records"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この目で · 行きたい · 個人の記録"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "亲见 · 行迹所至": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seen in person · Where you have been"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この目で · 訪れた場所"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今日到访已保存": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Today's visit saved"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "今日の訪問を保存しました"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今日到访，拖动进度 %lld%%": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Today's visit, dragged %lld%%"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "今日の訪問、ドラッグの進み具合 %lld%%"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "从 JSON 备份恢复记录；同一古迹以导入值覆盖，其余保留。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Restore records from a JSON backup. Entries for the same monument are replaced by the imported ones; everything else is kept."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JSON バックアップから記録を復元します。同じ古跡の記録は読み込んだ内容で上書きし、それ以外は保持します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "从任意圆点开始": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start from any dot"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "どの点からでも始められます"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "从汉阙到层叠殿阁，石与木记下漫长岁月。亲见的盖上印记，向往的收入心愿；一部慢慢写满的古迹图鉴。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "From Han-dynasty que gates to tiered halls, stone and timber hold the long passage of time. Stamp a seal on the places you have seen, keep the ones you long for on your wishlist — a field guide to monuments, filled in slowly."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "漢代の闕から幾重にも連なる殿閣まで、石と木が長い歳月を刻んできました。訪れた場所には印を押し、憧れの場所は「行きたい」に。少しずつ埋めていく古跡図鑑です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "佛光寺东大殿 · 柱头铺作": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "East Hall of Foguang Temple · Column-top bracket set"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仏光寺東大殿 · 柱頭組物"
